      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Environment Types Are Switches\nA deployment environment has a\n`deployment_type`: `production`, `staging`, or\nempty for a general environment ([environment \ndoc](https://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-pro\nvider-dbtcloud/blob/v1.13.1/docs/resources/env\nironment.md#L76)). The value is more than a\nlabel. dbt uses it to decide how references\nbetween projects resolve in dbt Mesh, and it\nsets the variable `DBT_CLOUD_ENVIRONMENT_TYPE`\nin each run ([project dependencies](https://do\ncs.getdbt.com/docs/mesh/govern/project-depende\nncies); [special variables](https://docs.getdb\nt.com/docs/build/environment-variables)). That\nvariable is `prod`, `staging`, or empty for a\ngeneral environment.\n\nThe environment `type`, development or\ndeployment, cannot change in place. A new\nvalue replaces the environment ([schema](https\n://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider-dbtc\nloud/blob/v1.13.1/pkg/framework/objects/enviro\nnment/schema.go#L234-L240)), and the pitfall\nReplacements Delete Jobs shows what follows.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-a840ba22ae5e",
      "originalText": "Environment Types Are Switches\nA deployment environment has a `deployment_type`: `production`, `staging`, or empty for a general environment ([environment doc](https://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider-dbtcloud/blob/v1.13.1/docs/resources/environment.md#L76)). The value is more than a label. dbt uses it to decide how references between projects resolve in dbt Mesh, and it sets the variable `DBT_CLOUD_ENVIRONMENT_TYPE` in each run ([project dependencies](https://docs.getdbt.com/docs/mesh/govern/project-dependencies); [special variables](https://docs.getdbt.com/docs/build/environment-variables)). That variable is `prod`, `staging`, or empty for a general environment.\n\nThe environment `type`, development or deployment, cannot change in place. A new value replaces the environment ([schema](https://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider-dbtcloud/blob/v1.13.1/pkg/framework/objects/environment/schema.go#L234-L240)), and the pitfall Replacements Delete Jobs shows what follows.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "environment-types-are-switches"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
