      "height": 560.0,
      "seed": 377940,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Two Provider Generations\nProvider 1.0.0 rewrote the provider on\nHashiCorp's newer Plugin Framework. It changed\nthe schema of several resources and removed\nthe old connection resources ([upgrade guide](\nhttps://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider\n-dbtcloud/blob/v1.13.1/docs/guides/90_upgradin\ng_from_v0_to_v1.md)). The Terraform Registry\nshows the docs of the latest version by\ndefault. A configuration pinned to 0.x needs\nthe 0.x docs, which GitHub keeps under the\ntag, for example [v0.3.26](https://github.com/\ndbt-labs/terraform-provider-dbtcloud/tree/v0.3\n.26/docs).\n\nSome arguments still exist but are deprecated:\n\n- `triggers.custom_branch_only`: the docs say\nto remove it; jobs now use the environment's\nbranch ([job doc](https://github.com/dbt-labs/\nterraform-provider-dbtcloud/blob/v1.13.1/docs/\nresources/job.md#L216)).\n- `timeout_seconds` on a job: use\n`execution.timeout_seconds` instead ([job doc]\n(https://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provide\nr-dbtcloud/blob/v1.13.1/docs/resources/job.md#\nL244)).\n- `deferring_job_id`: use\n`deferring_environment_id` instead ([job doc](\nhttps://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider\n-dbtcloud/blob/v1.13.1/docs/resources/job.md#L\n14)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-6bb3db4f7fda",
      "originalText": "Two Provider Generations\nProvider 1.0.0 rewrote the provider on HashiCorp's newer Plugin Framework. It changed the schema of several resources and removed the old connection resources ([upgrade guide](https://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider-dbtcloud/blob/v1.13.1/docs/guides/90_upgrading_from_v0_to_v1.md)). The Terraform Registry shows the docs of the latest version by default. A configuration pinned to 0.x needs the 0.x docs, which GitHub keeps under the tag, for example [v0.3.26](https://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider-dbtcloud/tree/v0.3.26/docs).\n\nSome arguments still exist but are deprecated:\n\n- `triggers.custom_branch_only`: the docs say to remove it; jobs now use the environment's branch ([job doc](https://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider-dbtcloud/blob/v1.13.1/docs/resources/job.md#L216)).\n- `timeout_seconds` on a job: use `execution.timeout_seconds` instead ([job doc](https://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider-dbtcloud/blob/v1.13.1/docs/resources/job.md#L244)).\n- `deferring_job_id`: use `deferring_environment_id` instead ([job doc](https://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider-dbtcloud/blob/v1.13.1/docs/resources/job.md#L14)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "two-provider-generations"
      }
    },
