    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2148666593,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-645fbdca96ef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 1420.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 665.0,
      "seed": 914566,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What You Will See\n| Resource | dbt Cloud object | What to check\n| Import ID |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `dbtcloud_project` | project | Its name and\nsubdirectory | `project_id` |\n| `dbtcloud_global_connection` | connection to\na data platform | Snowflake account, OAuth\nsettings, how other code finds it |\n`connection_id` |\n| `dbtcloud_repository`,\n`dbtcloud_project_repository` | Git repository\nand its link | Remote URL and provider |\n`project_id:repository_id` |\n| `dbtcloud_snowflake_credential` | deployment\ncredential | `auth_type`, database, schema,\nrole, warehouse, secret source |\n`project_id:credential_id` |\n| `dbtcloud_environment` | environment |\n`type`, `deployment_type`, `connection_id`,\n`credential_id`, `dbt_version` |\n`project_id:environment_id` |\n| `dbtcloud_environment_variable` | variable\nwith values per environment | Secret prefix,\nenvironment names as keys | `project_id:NAME`\n|\n| `dbtcloud_job` | job | `execute_steps`,\n`triggers`, `target_name`, `num_threads` |\n`job_id` |\n\nThe import IDs come from the Import section of\neach [resource doc](https://github.com/dbt-lab\ns/terraform-provider-dbtcloud/tree/v1.13.1/doc\ns/resources). A Terraform configuration can\ncreate jobs whose IDs other systems need, for\nexample a pipeline that starts runs through\nthe API. Find where the configuration outputs\nthose IDs.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-645fbdca96ef",
      "originalText": "What You Will See\n| Resource | dbt Cloud object | What to check | Import ID |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `dbtcloud_project` | project | Its name and subdirectory | `project_id` |\n| `dbtcloud_global_connection` | connection to a data platform | Snowflake account, OAuth settings, how other code finds it | `connection_id` |\n| `dbtcloud_repository`, `dbtcloud_project_repository` | Git repository and its link | Remote URL and provider | `project_id:repository_id` |\n| `dbtcloud_snowflake_credential` | deployment credential | `auth_type`, database, schema, role, warehouse, secret source | `project_id:credential_id` |\n| `dbtcloud_environment` | environment | `type`, `deployment_type`, `connection_id`, `credential_id`, `dbt_version` | `project_id:environment_id` |\n| `dbtcloud_environment_variable` | variable with values per environment | Secret prefix, environment names as keys | `project_id:NAME` |\n| `dbtcloud_job` | job | `execute_steps`, `triggers`, `target_name`, `num_threads` | `job_id` |\n\nThe import IDs come from the Import section of each [resource doc](https://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider-dbtcloud/tree/v1.13.1/docs/resources). A Terraform configuration can create jobs whose IDs other systems need, for example a pipeline that starts runs through the API. Find where the configuration outputs those IDs.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbtcloud-what-you-will-see"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7316514240,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-44ed3355e97a",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1309.2,
      "y": 1680.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 418.8,
      "height": 220.0,
      "seed": 250371,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3,
        "value": 8
      },
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "text-44ed3355e97a"
        },
