      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 22.5,
      "containerId": "node-6ccc9fa4f6d6",
      "originalText": "Pitfalls\nThe pitfalls fall into three groups: drift, replacements, and job settings.",
