    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6149681797,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-cd65dbccb6e3",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1900.0,
      "y": 2699.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 245.0,
      "seed": 604163,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Lookups by Name\nA configuration can find a global connection\nby its name, with the data source\n`dbtcloud_global_connections` and a filter. If\nsomeone renames the connection, the lookup\nreturns nothing and the environment create\nfails. Two connections can also share one\nname; the provider's changelog suggests a\ncheck that names do not repeat ([changelog](ht\ntps://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider-d\nbtcloud/blob/v0.3.26/CHANGELOG.md#L118-L121)).\nPass the connection ID from the state that\nowns the connection, or keep both in one\nstate.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-cd65dbccb6e3",
      "originalText": "Lookups by Name\nA configuration can find a global connection by its name, with the data source `dbtcloud_global_connections` and a filter. If someone renames the connection, the lookup returns nothing and the environment create fails. Two connections can also share one name; the provider's changelog suggests a check that names do not repeat ([changelog](https://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider-dbtcloud/blob/v0.3.26/CHANGELOG.md#L118-L121)). Pass the connection ID from the state that owns the connection, or keep both in one state.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "lookups-by-name"
      }
    },
