      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Authoritative Group Lists\n`dbtcloud_user_groups` owns the full list of\ngroups of a user. It removes any group that\nsomeone added in the UI ([user groups doc](htt\nps://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider-db\ntcloud/blob/v1.13.1/docs/resources/user_groups\n.md#L17)). A team that manages some groups in\ncode and others by hand loses the hand-made\nones at the next apply.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-b1a587786eaa",
      "originalText": "Authoritative Group Lists\n`dbtcloud_user_groups` owns the full list of groups of a user. It removes any group that someone added in the UI ([user groups doc](https://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider-dbtcloud/blob/v1.13.1/docs/resources/user_groups.md#L17)). A team that manages some groups in code and others by hand loses the hand-made ones at the next apply.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "authoritative-group-lists"
      }
    },
