    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6847474487,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-6f4b8cc2e483",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1891.6,
      "y": 3679.5,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 315.0,
      "seed": 100934,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Job Defaults Differ from the UI\nThe provider has its own defaults for two job\nsettings ([job schema](https://github.com/dbt-\nlabs/terraform-provider-dbtcloud/blob/v1.13.1/\npkg/framework/objects/job/schema.go#L541-L553)\n):\n\n- `target_name` defaults to `\"default\"`. A\nmacro or model that runs only when\n`target.name == 'prod'` silently skips that\nlogic.\n- `num_threads` defaults to 1. The UI suggests\n4 threads ([deploy jobs](https://docs.getdbt.c\nom/docs/deploy/deploy-jobs)), so a Terraform\njob without the setting runs one model at a\ntime.\n\nSet both on every job.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-6f4b8cc2e483",
      "originalText": "Job Defaults Differ from the UI\nThe provider has its own defaults for two job settings ([job schema](https://github.com/dbt-labs/terraform-provider-dbtcloud/blob/v1.13.1/pkg/framework/objects/job/schema.go#L541-L553)):\n\n- `target_name` defaults to `\"default\"`. A macro or model that runs only when `target.name == 'prod'` silently skips that logic.\n- `num_threads` defaults to 1. The UI suggests 4 threads ([deploy jobs](https://docs.getdbt.com/docs/deploy/deploy-jobs)), so a Terraform job without the setting runs one model at a time.\n\nSet both on every job.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "job-defaults-differ"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4518889250,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-56f75a338628",
