      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "About the Sources\nThe provider facts come from the\n`dbt-labs/dbtcloud` repository at tag v1.13.1, the\nlatest release on 2026-11-23, and at tag v0.3.26,\nthe last 0.x release. The dbt facts come from\ndocs.getdbt.com on the same day. No dbt Cloud API\nwas called to write this map.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 16.25,
      "containerId": "node-d68647715fd6",
      "originalText": "About the Sources\nThe provider facts come from the `dbt-labs/dbtcloud` repository at tag v1.13.1, the latest release on 2026-11-23, and at tag v0.3.26, the last 0.x release. The dbt facts come from docs.getdbt.com on the same day. No dbt Cloud API was called to write this map.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "dbtcloud-about-the-sources"
      }
    },
